andling dynamic JavaScript-rendered websites. Briefly touches on scaling challenges like CAPTCHAs and IP blocking, with a mention of Oxylabs Web Scraper API as a solution for larger projects.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rAgKfb7u6SQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-20T16:01:21.000Z"},{"id":"2CmgHC7BF","title":"ChatGPT Web Scraping  A Useful Tool or a Gimmick","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rQYy1SSMNU","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/chatgpt-web-scraping-a-useful-tool-or-a-gimmick-2cmghc7bf","summary":"A beginner-friendly walkthrough on using ChatGPT to generate web scraping code with Python and BeautifulSoup. Covers the full process: locating HTML elements via browser DevTools, crafting effective prompts with CSS selectors, reviewing and executing the generated code, and handling encoding issues. Also covers tips like using ChatGPT for code editing, linting, performance optimization, and handling dynamic JavaScript content. Limitations are discussed, including ChatGPT's knowledge cutoff, hallucination risk, and inability to bypass anti-scraping measures like CAPTCHAs and rate limiting.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0rQYy1SSMNU/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-15T15:00:02.000Z"},{"id":"yZ2fmXKEi","title":"What is RAG in AI?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Y6Ljy_Ju_w","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-rag-in-ai--yz2fmxkei","summary":"RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) is an AI technique where relevant information \u2014 such as documentation, files, or web data \u2014 is retrieved first and then provided as context to a language model before it generates an answer. This allows the model to go beyond its training data by grounding responses in up-to-date or domain-specific information. The core idea: find first, then generate.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_Y6Ljy_Ju_w/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_a